{"unit_id":"yh01010__dsh-mcp-matlab#feature-1","repo":"yh01010/dsh-mcp-matlab","commit":"3d2f8d29e0dd016480adfaedc5c249265c597b89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-matlab 的功能「连接本地 MATLAB MCP Server」：通过 profile bundle 配置 stdio transport 和服务器启动命令。DSH 启动时由宿主 MCP 客户端连接该进程，并接入其工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:45-55"]}
