{"unit_id":"yh01010__dsh-mcp-matlab#feature-3","repo":"yh01010/dsh-mcp-matlab","commit":"3d2f8d29e0dd016480adfaedc5c249265c597b89","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-matlab 的功能「延长工具调用等待时间」：将配置的单次工具调用超时设为 120000 毫秒，适用于 MATLAB 冷启动或加载工具箱耗时较长的情况。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:35-37","cordis.patch.yml:56"]}
{"unit_id":"yh01010__dsh-mcp-matlab#caveat-1","repo":"yh01010/dsh-mcp-matlab","commit":"3d2f8d29e0dd016480adfaedc5c249265c597b89","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mcp-matlab 使用前须知：配置中的服务器命令和 MATLAB 根目录是占位路径，需改成本机实际路径，否则无法连接并注册工具。（见 cordis.patch.yml:14-17,51-54）","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:14-17","cordis.patch.yml:51-54"]}
